  <description type="2" xml:lang="EN">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The Program Development Objective (PDO) is to enhance the Recipient&apos;s regulatory framework and institutional capacity to: (i) manage and reduce the risks from natural disasters and climate change; and (ii) to better manage public debt and enhance debt transparency.</narrative>
  </description>
